{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0513_1000_040tam", "source_sha256": "8579114baa317fe951331f4cd7ce33d8bbc13c7703f6b61d1a3243926dcbe32b", "ja": "うわ～！？　ボールが逃げちゃった～！\n待って待って～！", "zh": "哇～！？球跑掉了～！\n等等我等等我～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0513_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5cd91bd3109cf0de48467b35dc82caf4104bd0eb48d1e1b2f047ef08f9c1ea7c", "ja": "（環が元気にバスケットボールを追いかけている……。\n何をやっているんだろう？）", "zh": "（环正精神十足地追着篮球跑……她到底在做什么呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0513_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "778716ff3c3c046659a85b85c04834fd418210648e3b4f0783d77fd1ff4b296a", "ja": "よーし、もう一回……。あっ、おやぶんだ！\nねえねえ、おやぶんも一緒にバスケの特訓する？", "zh": "好——，再来一次……啊，是老大！\n我说我说，老大也要一起进行篮球特训吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0513_1003_p", "source_sha256": "128b5895ec597bba8fbb039eb7f93577ab055a0f5967bc1975cf3b99929dd622", "ja": "バスケ……あ！\nもうすぐだったな。事務所対抗のバスケ大会。", "zh": "篮球……啊！\n事务所之间的篮球比赛快到了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0513_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "3235534fb687e7f71ecda4f3f18995129729c3fa823e6433fb8d329ec0e24b1b", "ja": "うんっ！　たくさん見に来るから、たまきのカッコいい\nところ、見せようと思って。がんばって練習してるの！", "zh": "嗯！因为到时候会有很多人来看，所以我想让大家看看环的帅气一面。最近一直在努力练习呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0513_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cc6c2a65269c4143e741ad4fe9e19f75adc2398dbff1e42c1ee3f101ebd4f946", "ja": "はは、張り切ってるみたいだな。\nちなみにどんな練習をしてるんだ？", "zh": "哈哈，看来你干劲十足啊。\n顺便问一下，你都在练习些什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0513_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "6e02e4f088fab1371b93d0acfd4a72e22f03b8856e157473f6192a5e6f770e97", "ja": "ドリブルっ！　たまき、けっこう得意なんだぞ～！\nこの前も、体育のバスケで3人抜かしたんだ。", "zh": "运球！环，还是挺擅长的哦～！\n前几天体育课打篮球时，还甩开了3个人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0513_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f9f326110278a4a109eb18bfdc9c6f3ba4fbe5fafc429a1a4c6deffd8a001d59", "ja": "おお、それはすごい。でも、そんなに得意なら\n他のことを練習してもいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "哦，那可真厉害。不过，既然你这么擅长，\n练习一下其他的事情不也挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0513_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "2306531d36c25572046f8eb30ee206522a19b4ac15aaa1601b62817261460649", "ja": "ううん。たまき、もっとドリブルがうまくなりたい！\n得意でも、たまにボール落としちゃうし……。", "zh": "不要。环想把运球练得更好！\n虽然擅长，但偶尔还是会掉球……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0513_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "7813b264c6a6ef980bcdff6e68fbf4dcb9436304521674f6f77385a03bd84d50", "ja": "それに、大会はつよーい相手がいっぱいだから。\nもっともっと、うまくならないと勝てないでしょ？", "zh": "而且，大赛里有很多很强的对手。要是不能变得更厉害更厉害，就赢不了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0513_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c21b57c69e36c5f5aeb74ae0db5abdcfc7ebc35223792699c4639b8590ffd2c8", "ja": "たしかに……学校の授業とは違うからな。\n対戦相手も、環より年上の人が多いだろうし。", "zh": "确实……毕竟和学校的课不一样。\n对手大多也会比环年长吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0513_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "e665700abbccf90ac913fa7f13f12cee7d61855d9c29ddf6510c8ef2423ff10c", "ja": "うん。たまきより背の高い人がいたら、\nきっと、たまきのシュートは止められちゃうし……。", "zh": "嗯。要是有比环个子高的人在，\n环的投篮肯定会被拦下来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0513_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "379404195ef1bb044f92ec4ebd6f299ac500c9f4609dc2e4f4ced63b875eaba1", "ja": "でも、ドリブルなら背の高さは関係ないもんね～！\nたまきがシュシュッと抜かして、大活躍するの！", "zh": "不过，要是运球的话，个子高矮就没关系啦～！\n环可以嗖嗖地过掉对手，大显身手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0513_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9a2a1b4281b60b4dd395c34e5004b675f763464068d82a137d1dd49d6a973014", "ja": "なるほど。環にとってドリブルは、\n大事な武器なんだな。", "zh": "原来如此。对环来说，运球就是重要的武器啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0513_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "580261140ff01e64f1b8d10691ba42cb9cab049f48233fa46f1f3ece27f641f5", "ja": "うんっ、武器！　だから練習がんばるんだ～♪", "zh": "嗯，武器！所以我会努力练习的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0513_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f4066f1007f374e98f5a3e5320df997cd3e0616b8addea5f3dab14c0a518814e", "ja": "そうか……。よし、だったら練習に付き合うよ！\n相手がいた方が、本番の感覚に近いだろ？", "zh": "这样啊……好，那我陪你练习吧！\n有对手的话，会更接近正式比赛时的感觉吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0513_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "fb099951dd1808d67593665111c844a0e27d4c8a4445257442cb4c80fdadee06", "ja": "ほんと！？　わ～い！　おやぶん、ありがとう～！\nじゃあ、ドリブル勝負、100本やるぞ～っ♪", "zh": "真的！？　耶～！老大，谢谢你～！\n那就来比100次运球吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0513_1017_p", "source_sha256": "49ebbd6c75e03054d2249b813436ee8a0843e4f681059b216f2ecc38a0cb740a", "ja": "え……？　100本？", "zh": "诶……？100次？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0513_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "9d861a25a2f22fded81709201d4d755a3001fd9ef72f08731dc036afb9efc360", "ja": "たまき、がんばるね！　誰にも止められないような\nすっごいドリブル、マスターするぞ～♪", "zh": "环，努力加油！我要掌握谁都阻止不了的超厉害运球～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
